flowchart TB
 E[Open / manual sync / maintenance] --> D[Discover source pages with shared pacing]
 D --> S[Preserve choices: inputs ON, generated OFF by default]
 S --> EN{Source enabled and accessible?}
 EN -->|no| KEEP[Keep confirmed membership / show status]
 EN -->|yes| KIND{Liked Songs or playlist?}
 KIND -->|Liked| L[Resume bounded saved-track passes]
 KIND -->|Playlist| V[Read snapshot / skip unchanged complete source]
 L --> P[Read at most 50 items / batch persistence]
 V --> P
 P --> M{More pages?}
 M -->|yes| P
 M -->|no| CHECK{Complete consistent membership?}
 CHECK -->|no| RETRY[Keep prior membership / bounded retry]
 RETRY --> KIND
 CHECK -->|yes| COMMIT[Replace this source membership only]
 COMMIT --> POOL[Enabled membership union / preserve tags]
 POOL --> GROUP[Exact title and artist grouping / eligible representative]
 GROUP --> CACHE[Invalidate library, queue and query revision]
 CACHE --> GATE[Generation waits for complete enabled imports]
